{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年39歲嘅前港姐冠軍陳庭欣，去年12月與拍拖8年嘅「10億太子」楊振源分手，一度被指豪門夢碎嘅佢，轉投身Pickleball（匹克球）界闖出一片天，帶領香港眾藝人發展運動人生，今日（20日）有消息指佢分手未夠一年已治愈情傷，新戀情曝光！</p><p>據</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.313964+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:29:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.514836+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.514836+00:00","content_hash":"18c490021528f3ec58015f1c3cb61647144aaf56cd2fdab3a09afc28de1eddea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}